# Job Pilot Agent — Development Learning Log

## Project Goal
Build an open-source, cloud-based AI agent that discovers jobs, tailors resumes, checks ATS readiness, and supports human-approved or automated applications.

## Step 1 — Git & GitHub

### Concepts Learned
- Repository: The home for project files and version history.
- Branch: An isolated line of development.
- Commit: A recorded snapshot of changes.
- Pull Request: A proposal to review and merge changes.
- Merge: Incorporating changes from one branch into another.

## Development Principles
- Learn by building.
- Keep personal information and API keys private.
- Prioritize free and open-source tools.
- Test changes before merging into main.
- Keep application automation transparent and user-controlled.
